        "original_id": "6f20b2d4-2de7-50da-996f-624b407d32a6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Lightfoot, Rupert Glasson, Ivan Milat, Bradley Murdoch\n- Films: Wolf Creek, Rogue, Coffin Rock\n- Topics: horror films, true-event marketing, tourist murders\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Ivan Milat committed real-life murders of tourists that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- In 2001, Bradley Murdoch committed a real-life tourist murder that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- Wolf Creek was ambiguously marketed as being based on true events.\n- David Lightfoot worked on the horror films Wolf Creek and Rogue.\n- Coffin Rock is an Australian melodramatic thriller film directed by Rupert Glasson.\n- Coffin Rock was produced by David Lightfoot.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
